ame": "Akshay", "text": "Dusre direction", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:12:57Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Go towards the sun", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:13:02Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Z is Neptune", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:13:19Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "A is Uranus", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:13:51Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Fir Y hua Mercury?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:14:02Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Y is Mercury!", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:14:18Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Saare ho gaye", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:14:25Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "X is the Vulcan Theory\nY is Mercury\nZ is Neptune\nA is Uranus\nB Einstein", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:14:35Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Great q!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:16:30Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Urbain Le verrier had made a name for himself because he used the observed perturbations in uranus orbit to posit the existence of a planet adjacent to it, which was eventually discovered. When astronomers saw similar spinning in Mercury’s orbital trajectory, he became convinced there was a planet nearby that was influencing its motion. But that turned out to be incorrect and the precession in Mercury’s orbit was explained later using general relativity.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:17:01Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "He named this planet Vulcan", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:17:47Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "But in reality it was due to the mass of the sun curving spacetime", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:17:55Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "*is", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:19:05Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Wiki article: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vulcan_(hypothetical_planet)?wprov=sfti1#Hypotheses_and_observations", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T07:20:54Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Ok i wasn’t a part of the broader conversation i was reading it though. A genuine question - there is anyway not a very popular belief in a Jewish lobby uniquely dictating US foreign policy, right? Which kind of makes this Vulcan theory an exaggerated defense?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]